  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): シクンシ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B7%E3%82%AF%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B7",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 110158024,
      "text": "シクンシ はシクンシ科シクンシ属の木本性つる植物。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Combretum indicum",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combretum_indicum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1332884804,
      "text": "Combretum indicum, commonly known as the Rangoon creeper or Burma creeper, is a vine with red flower clusters which is native to tropical Asia and grows in thickets, primary and secondary forest, and along river banks in the Indian subcontinent, Malaysia and the Philippines. It has since been cultivated and naturalized in tropical areas such as Burma, Vietnam, and Thailand."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Combretum indicum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Combretum_indicum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175439538,
      "text": "Quisqualis indica, piscuala, es una especie de planta fanerógama de la familia Combretaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Quisqualis indica",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quisqualis_indica",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 223125906,
      "text": "Quisqualis indica, connue sous le nom de Caractère des hommes aux Antilles et en Guyane, ainsi que celui de « liane vermifuge » ailleurs, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Combretaceae. C'est une liane originaire des régions tropicales d'Afrique et d'Asie. Elle a été naturalisée ailleurs."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Ceguk",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ceguk",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 30061178,
      "text": "Ceguk adalah perdu dengan akar yang merambat atau memanjang dengan panjang dari 2-8 m yang berasal dari Myanmar dan bisa ditemui di ketinggian 600 mdpl. Ceguk dikenal pula dengan nama melati belanda, dani, udani, wudani (Melayu), bidani (Sunda), kacekluk, kaceklik, ceguk, cekluk, wedani (Jawa), rabet dani (Madura), kunyi-rhabet, rhabet besi, sarandengan (Kangean), dan tikao (Bugis)."
    }
  },
